<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 9747 0 R/Alt(Position x, in units of the step size, against the number of steps n, from 0 to 1000. Five jagged lines, drawn in different colours and line styles, start at the origin and wander up and down. Two thick black curves, plus and minus the square root of n, open up from the origin and reach plus and minus about 32 at n equal to 1000. Some of the walks stay between the two curves, while others wander outside of them; one reaches about 110.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 20731 0 R>>
